  "description": "TOLXAV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C57 H58 N16 O12 Tb4 4+,2(C1 H4 O1),4(N1 O3 1-),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.766-3.837 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.19-113.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C59H74Tb4N20O30. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
